OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwill speak with Vladimir Putin soon
OL,8,Fabout the death of a lab worker at a
OL,9,Fplague research centre in Siberia.
OL,11,F"So far we are in very deep
OL,12,Fdiscussions," Trump said, adding that
OL,13,Fhe would be able to report on his talks
OL,14,Fwith the Russian leader "probably" on
OL,15,FThursday. Kremlin spokesman Dmitry
OL,16,FPeskov said no phone call had been
OL,17,Fscheduled.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
