OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian officials say they are
OL,7,Finvestigating the cause of the
OL,8,F28-year-old's death and have not
OL,9,Fconfirmed that the suspected disease is
OL,10,Fpneumonic plague. They insist there is
OL,11,Fno risk of an epidemic.
OL,13,FMongolia has ordered "surveillance
OL,14,Fmeasures" on its border, AFP reports,
OL,15,Fwhile Lithuania has made preparations
OL,16,Ffor any possible case.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
